==Strategy==
Control the R.Ost with [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless Cats]] like [[Lone Cat and Kitten (Rare Cat)|Vendor Cat and Kitten]] and/or [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]], all while spamming [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]] to kill the R.Ost. The Wafer Cats may pose an issue, but running 4 or 5 cheap meatshields will render them a non-issue.

